      <profiles>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="3eb6-0c1f-740d-c623" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Elevated Strider" id="cd08-3a8f-4c0c-0941" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT].
The unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Fell Back.
You can re-roll the Desperate Escape roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Broad Spectrum Data-tether" id="1728-6b92-3620-cd63" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time you target the unit with a Stratagem:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
