      <profiles>
        <profile name="Focused Hunters" id="078d-8ed7-a5a6-1273" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit (your Focused Hunters Target). For the rest of the battle, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it, you can re-roll the Hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth" id="beb6-4218-8853-6e63" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Stealth ability, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="dae5-72fc-5282-e033" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Broad Spectrum Data-tether" id="2c84-bef1-e6bc-a29b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time you target the unit with a Stratagem:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
