      <profiles>
        <profile name="Infiltrators" id="c548-3fa8-f72b-ae7a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Infiltrators ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Neurostatic Interference (Aura)" id="82fe-7981-fc11-3bb0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit takes a Battle-shock test or when the unit takes a Leadership test, while an enemy unit is within 6" of this unit, while the unit is not within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit, that unit gets -1 to Battle-shock rolls; that unit gets -1 to Leadership rolls; while the unit is within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit, that unit gets -2 to Battle-shock rolls; that unit gets -2 to Leadership rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Voices in the Code" id="af4e-c8d6-b269-76c2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, once per phase per army:
  For each enemy unit: While the unit is within Engagement Range of a friendly unit with the Voices in the Code ability, the unit must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth" id="cc76-1ccc-eba0-9432" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Stealth ability, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
