            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">50mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Dataspike" id="5831-8403-7bc9-4fac" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, you may use this ability, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy VEHICLE unit if the selected unit is within Engagement Range of the unit:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 4+, that unit suffers D6 mortal wounds; worsen the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="03cc-1e2e-eb02-8f76" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lord of the Machine Cult" id="664b-f4c0-0b11-2e30" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit:
  -&gt; Unless the unit has the ELECTRO-PRIESTS keyword, the unit has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability.
  -&gt; If the unit has the ELECTRO-PRIESTS keyword, the unit has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
