      <profiles>
        <profile name="Ride the Thermals" id="86f3-9255-994f-7d9d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, while the unit is unengaged, until the end of the turn:
  Select exactly 1 distinct options:
    - The triggering unit can make a Normal move of up to 6".
    - The triggering unit can make a Normal move of up to 12"; it must end that move where the unit is wholly within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit.
  -&gt; The unit cannot declare a charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="32f5-2837-49c2-1ba9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
