      <profiles>
        <profile name="Electro-shock" id="2f49-dca5-05a9-11b1" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of your opponent's next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit does not have the MONSTER keyword and the selected unit does not have the VEHICLE keyword and the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as shocked.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged shocked, subtract 2 from that unit's Move characteristic.
    While the selected unit is tagged shocked:
      -&gt; This unit gets -2 to Advance rolls.
      -&gt; This unit gets -2 to Charge rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="2ef4-8f01-a55e-29b7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
