      <profiles>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="234a-2aab-a98a-91bf" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tactica Obliqua" id="7872-d911-2e06-1940" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit ends a move, you may use this ability, during the Movement phase, in the opponent's turn, while the triggering unit is within 8" of the unit, while the unit is unengaged:
  Select exactly 1 distinct options:
    - The unit can make a Normal move of up to D6".
    - The unit can make a Normal move of up to 6"; it must end that move where the unit is wholly within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Doctrina Imperatives" id="f695-7e1f-c586-05c5" hidden="false" targetId="01d3-b088-6c56-897a" type="rule"/>
