      <profiles>
        <profile name="Dynamic Efficiency" id="b153-6f1d-452d-e2d6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: The unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.
The unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.
You can re-roll the Desperate Escape roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth" id="5359-9c4c-842b-bb30" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Stealth ability, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="d578-4d58-660c-c3d3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Broad Spectrum Data-tether" id="27d5-a3c9-5262-2f1c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time you target the unit with a Stratagem:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
