      <profiles>
        <profile name="Line-breakers" id="b1d4-67c3-4dfb-f226" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends a Charge move:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit is within Engagement Range of the unit:
    -&gt; While the unit was within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit at the start of that move, roll one D6 for each friendly model in the unit that is within Engagement Range of the selected unit: for each 2+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
    -&gt; Unless the unit was within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit at the start of that move, roll one D6 for each friendly model in the unit that is within Engagement Range of the selected unit: for each 4+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
