      <profiles>
        <profile name="Searing Conflagration" id="3741-95cc-bb6c-45fd" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making attacks made with phosphor torch, while the target is within range of an objective marker:
  -&gt; While the unit is not within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit, you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1.
  -&gt; While the unit is within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="6a38-60e0-c697-a927" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
