    <selectionEntry name="Detachment" id="c82f-1b42-946-9c9a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="3181-4a28-c857-4b32" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="3545-d2fe-3bd1-b6fe" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="c606-6ad6-624b-9390" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4ac9-fd30-1e3d-b249"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachment" id="588c-ab20-fba0-64fb" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="4ba1-b1c0-4744-ad78" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Haloscreed Battle Clade" id="d63b-2ce0-99f8-f8c7" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="f41d-5553-ad6f-063b" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Noospheric Transference" id="adfc-5e64-fc6f-e649" hidden="false">
                  <description>During the Command phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Command phase:
  -&gt; Select from one through 1/2/3 (Incursion/Strike Force/Onslaught) friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS units:
    -&gt; For each selected unit:
      -&gt; That unit gains the HALO OVERRIDE keyword.
      Select exactly 1 distinct options (Override Ability):
        - Add 2 to all friendly HALO OVERRIDE units' Move characteristic.
        - Add 1 to all friendly HALO OVERRIDE units' Toughness characteristic.
        - All friendly HALO OVERRIDE units are eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which they Advanced.
        - All friendly HALO OVERRIDE units gain the Stealth ability.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="163b-0433-e8d0-4203" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Cohort Cybernetica" id="f67d-6f59-21b8-e1f9" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="6166-8991-aa0b-91a2" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Cyber-psalm Programming" id="a464-1db7-2442-8fd3" hidden="false">
                  <description>Add 2 to all friendly LEGIO CYBERNETICA units' Move characteristic.
While a friendly LEGIO CYBERNETICA unit is not Battle-shocked, add 1 to that unit's Objective Control characteristic.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="d9c9-a130-1178-0652" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Skitarii Hunter Cohort" id="48bd-eeae-171d-a10a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="59aa-dd54-6cdf-ce4f" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Stealth Optimisation" id="4456-35bc-a8c6-e152" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly INFANTRY SKITARII, IRONSTRIDER BALLISTARII or MOUNTED SKITARII units gain the Stealth ability.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="cc4b-b302-88d7-bc19" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Data-psalm Conclave" id="e282-2b49-bd6a-679c" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="6912-a83a-706e-2c68" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Benedictions of the Omnissiah" id="715a-5391-9800-dc9e" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the start of the battle round, during the first battle round, for the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; Select one (each may be chosen once per battle):
    - Panegyric Procession: while making ranged attacks, while the attacking unit is a friendly CULT MECHANICUS unit, while the target is within half the attacking weapon's range, improve all friendly CULT MECHANICUS models' Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.
    - Citation in Savagery: when a friendly unit is selected to fight (the triggering unit must have CULT MECHANICUS), until the end of the phase: if the triggering unit charged this turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the triggering unit; add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the triggering unit.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="f282-d60b-18b2-42f3" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
                <categoryLink name="Detachment Tag: data-psalm" id="d320-c32f-f6fc-65f6" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="e21c-0b55-62a4-74fd"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Explorator Maniple" id="e01f-8783-4769-2eb6" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="5911-2256-dac2-a6a2" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Acquisition at any Cost" id="3eed-da3c-05dd-d540" hidden="false">
                  <description>While the unit is within range of an objective marker tagged acquisition or while the target is within range of an objective marker tagged acquisition, until the start of your next Command phase, you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="344b-688a-8c8f-0ad8" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Rad-Zone Corps" id="7aa5-4c0c-40c3-e2a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="9835-94a9-3d3c-6689" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Rad-Bombardment" id="69ed-ec04-8369-af47" hidden="false">
                  <description>-&gt; At the start of the battle round: during the first battle round, for each enemy unit: while the unit is within enemy deployment zone, your opponent selects one of the following: roll one D6: on a 3+, the unit suffers D3 mortal wounds / the unit is Battle-shocked; roll one D6: on a 5+, the unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
-&gt; At the start of your Command phase:
  For each enemy unit:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 3+, from the second battle round onward, during battle rounds 2-5, while the unit is within enemy deployment zone, the unit suffers 1 mortal wound; from the second battle round onward, during battle rounds 2-5, while the unit is within enemy deployment zone, the unit must take a Battle-shock test.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="e226-6b2f-193f-9c4a" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Cohort Acquisitus" id="02e5-7fe0-d054-0209" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="27b3-ef06-d4ad-56c8" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Noospheric Recon" id="cf4e-35db-33bf-5862" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly units with the INFILTRATORS, PTERAXII, RANGERS, SERBERYS RAIDERS or SERBERYS SULPHURHOUNDS keyword gain the RECON AUGURY keyword.
All friendly RECON AUGURY units gain the Enhanced Augurs ability:
  -&gt; You can, until the end of the phase: during the Shooting phase, in your turn, select one enemy unit visible to this model if the selected unit is within 12" of the unit: that unit is marked as analysed; while the selected unit is tagged analysed, add 3 to that unit's detection range characteristic.
Applies to: units with ADEPTUS MECHANICUS.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="30e4-b4ec-3d6e-20b9" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Lords of the Forge" id="24e2-b690-37b5-de9e" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="2cde-3b59-252a-4495" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="War-form Mantles" id="0867-deb9-5f2e-a8b9" hidden="false">
                  <description>For the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; All friendly units have a 4+ invulnerable save.
  -&gt; All friendly units have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability.
Applies to: units with TECH-PRIEST.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="c6bb-b47b-65e5-dc6f" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Luminen Auto-choir" id="65e6-9ab1-6a2c-5410" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="37ca-8836-5e93-0033" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Cyber-static Canticles" id="15c8-d651-ad18-1762" hidden="false">
                  <description>For the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; Against CORPUSCARII targets, ranged weapons equipped by all friendly units gain [LETHAL HITS].
  Against FULGURITE targets:
    -&gt; After a friendly unit fights (the triggering unit must have FULGURITE): the triggering unit regains up to D3 lost wounds.
Applies to: units with ADEPTUS MECHANICUS.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="3762-564c-63f3-cf20" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
                <categoryLink name="Detachment Tag: data-psalm" id="8a8d-759f-7c2a-f1d4" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="e21c-0b55-62a4-74fd"/>
              </categoryLinks>
