  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Doctrina Imperatives" id="01d3-b088-6c56-897a" hidden="false">
      <description>At the start of the battle round, you may use this ability, until the end of the battle round:
  -&gt; Select one:
    - PROTECTOR IMPERATIVE: ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [HEAVY]; improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit by 1; against melee attacks, if the unit has the BATTLELINE keyword or while the unit is within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit, the attacking unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.
    - CONQUEROR IMPERATIVE: ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT]; improve the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in this unit by 1; if the unit has the BATTLELINE keyword or while the unit is within 6" of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit, improve the unit's Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
